Getting help
============

* Learn how to install: https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/guides/installation
* Fix an error: https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/guides/troubleshooting
* Find a function: https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/api/README or the Functions panel in the editor
* Ask a question: Discussions tab
* Report a bug: Bug report (../../issues/new?template=bug_report.yml)
* Suggest a feature: Feature request (../../issues/new?template=feature_request.yml)
* Report a security issue: https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/SECURITY

Please include your Packet Tracer version and the smallest script that shows the problem.
